{"unit_id":"Yinbenfeng__dsh-plugin-quick-draw-Tool-#feature-1","repo":"Yinbenfeng/dsh-plugin-quick-draw-Tool-","commit":"503e88c3b583b2f9738ff905d23c12fe8fd002fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Quick Draw Tool 的「提示词生成图片」功能：在 DSH 面板填写一段或两段提示词并提交后，插件把提示词、尺寸、步数和种子写入固定工作流，交给本机 ComfyUI 执行并返回图片预览。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:75-110"]}
