{"unit_id":"Yinbenfeng__dsh-plugin-quick-draw-Tool-#caveat-1","repo":"Yinbenfeng/dsh-plugin-quick-draw-Tool-","commit":"503e88c3b583b2f9738ff905d23c12fe8fd002fe","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Quick Draw Tool 需要预先安装并启动本机 ComfyUI；插件默认访问 http://127.0.0.1:8188，可通过 DSH_COMFYUI_URL 更改地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:10","src/index.js:52-54"]}
{"unit_id":"Yinbenfeng__dsh-plugin-quick-draw-Tool-#caveat-2","repo":"Yinbenfeng/dsh-plugin-quick-draw-Tool-","commit":"503e88c3b583b2f9738ff905d23c12fe8fd002fe","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Quick Draw Tool 的生成提示词和工作流会发送到所配置的 ComfyUI 服务；若仍使用默认地址，服务位于本机。保存操作会将图片写入用户指定的绝对路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:91-100","src/index.js:153-174"]}
